# .gitignore — Society Management documentation project
#
# Ignores installed dependencies and build-generated artifacts only. Everything
# authored or required as a deliverable stays tracked, in particular:
#   - the authored documentation Markdown (docs/**/*.md),
#   - the source trees (src/, tests/),
#   - the consolidated PDF deliverable (docs/Society-Management-Documentation.pdf),
#   - the dependency manifest (package.json),
#   - the delivered archive (society_mgmt_300k.zip).

# Dependencies
# Installed by `npm install` from the documentation toolchain declared in package.json.
node_modules/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Generated documentation artifacts
# Mermaid diagrams are rendered to SVG by `mmdc` into docs/assets/diagrams/ on every
# docs build, so the generated *.svg contents of that directory are not tracked. The
# directory itself is preserved via its .gitkeep placeholder, and the authored Mermaid
# *.mmd source files (the build inputs that mmdc renders into the SVGs) are tracked —
# both are re-included below. Note: there is intentionally no blanket "*.pdf" rule —
# the consolidated PDF deliverable under docs/ is committed.
docs/assets/diagrams/*
!docs/assets/diagrams/.gitkeep
!docs/assets/diagrams/*.mmd

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
